        <mxCell id="GdJUmdt5wvaW0a0Rx8G_-1" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;" value="Functional Requirements&lt;div&gt;1. User can create account and login&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. User can pay for subscription&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. User can download the movies&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. User can add movies to their watchlist&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;5. Users can search for movies, filter via language, category&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;6. Users can like and dislike movies&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;7. users can create new profiles and manage them&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;8. Users should be able to change their playback speed and video resolution.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
